Hi Christina,

1. I wanted to make sure that you did try to include an intercept term. I would.
2. The mathematical draw of distance^2 as a response variable is that if you have additive error contributions, then you get an additive variance model. But with a log link, there should be no difference. A log link would make sense if the effects are multiplicative.

Best,
Chris

